+  "snippet": "Write a short, friendly, one-sentence welcome for the customer named {{custmerName}}.",
+  "cause": "The greet prompt template references the misspelled variable {{custmerName}}, which is never supplied, so Handlebars renders it as empty and the model receives no customer name, while the flow correctly passes customerName.",
